WEBVTT

00:00:06.004 --> 00:00:07.074
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.
Remember, when you watch TV...

00:00:07.074 --> 00:00:09.344
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.
Turn on the lights and sit back from the TV!

00:00:09.344 --> 00:00:09.934
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.

00:00:15.614 --> 00:00:19.014
What's with you two, just
drinking that weak stuff?

00:00:19.684 --> 00:00:23.514
You need to drink this stuff, or else
we're gonna waste a long night!

00:00:29.494 --> 00:00:30.494
Are you okay?

00:00:30.494 --> 00:00:32.424
What are you doing?

00:00:33.664 --> 00:00:36.334
Now, now, you must be careful.

00:00:36.334 --> 00:00:38.354
You'll spoil that pretty face.

00:00:39.704 --> 00:00:41.334
Who are you? A pedo?

00:00:41.804 --> 00:00:44.674
Unfortunately, we've already
got a man in our lives!

00:00:46.044 --> 00:00:50.534
That's a shame, but peoples'
hearts do change, don't they?

00:00:53.854 --> 00:00:55.684
I can't read him!

00:00:59.354 --> 00:01:00.984
Who was that?

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:10.864
Huh? There are two Mr. Tanakas
from the Ministry of Finance?

00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:15.844
Let's see... I think this is the Mr. Tanaka...

00:01:15.844 --> 00:01:18.004
who doesn't change his underwear for 3 days.

00:01:18.004 --> 00:01:20.974
And who secretly has a crush on Dr. Sakaki-

00:01:20.974 --> 00:01:22.204
Don't say that!

00:01:23.214 --> 00:01:25.374
I'll see to your business.

00:01:25.684 --> 00:01:26.814
Huh?

00:01:26.814 --> 00:01:28.754
What's wrong, Natsuko?

00:01:28.754 --> 00:01:31.774
I feel like someone just walked in.

00:01:38.464 --> 00:01:39.584
From now on...

00:01:40.064 --> 00:01:42.494
Shoot! Eliminate the espers!

00:01:43.334 --> 00:01:45.424
More incidents like that may occur.

00:01:45.664 --> 00:01:49.624
Will I be able to protect
The Children on my own?

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:52.944
His skill's amazing.

00:01:52.944 --> 00:01:54.774
Oh, that's no good.

00:01:54.774 --> 00:01:58.574
I haven't shot in so long, I'm out of practice.

00:01:59.484 --> 00:02:02.984
You aren't bad, but your heart isn't in it.

00:02:02.984 --> 00:02:05.924
You won't protect The Children like that.

00:02:05.924 --> 00:02:07.444
Who are you?

00:02:08.624 --> 00:02:10.994
Ask Kiritsubo about me.

00:02:11.194 --> 00:02:13.324
I imagine he'll have a lot to tell you.

00:02:13.794 --> 00:02:16.894
He teleported! He's an esper?!

00:02:17.364 --> 00:02:20.264
Kanari kiteru Muteki no Power!

00:02:20.674 --> 00:02:23.534
Maji de ii kanji

00:02:23.904 --> 00:02:26.674
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:02:27.114 --> 00:02:30.274
Ashita e saa ikou!

00:02:32.184 --> 00:02:33.354
Zettai Karen Children

00:02:33.354 --> 00:02:34.484
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:02:34.484 --> 00:02:35.784
Zettai Karen Children
Zettai!

00:02:35.784 --> 00:02:37.424
Zettai Karen Children

00:02:37.424 --> 00:02:38.474
Zettai Karen Children
Daitan!

00:02:38.654 --> 00:02:41.924
Fureau dake de wakaru

00:02:41.924 --> 00:02:44.394
Kokoro no limiter

00:02:45.124 --> 00:02:47.794
Tokihanatareta hora

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:51.424
Yes! Change the world!

00:02:51.664 --> 00:02:54.534
Atsui battle Nandomo try!

00:02:54.834 --> 00:02:58.144
Real wo tsuranuite

00:02:58.144 --> 00:03:01.374
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:03:01.374 --> 00:03:04.314
Thrill ga SAIKOU!

00:03:05.444 --> 00:03:11.924
Yuuki ga sekai no yami wo terashi hajimeru

00:03:11.924 --> 00:03:17.824
Anata ga kureta kiseki afureru

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:24.664
Darenimo nitenai egao hokori ni shitara

00:03:24.904 --> 00:03:29.444
Mirai wo ima koeyou

00:03:29.444 --> 00:03:33.534
We can try over the future world!

00:03:33.774 --> 00:03:34.144
Yeah!

00:03:34.874 --> 00:03:35.534
Saidai!

00:03:37.684 --> 00:03:38.904
Daitan!

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:50.814
8th sense.
"Kyosuke Hyobu! Ah! He's Appeared?"

00:03:53.394 --> 00:03:56.334
My name is Muscle Ohkama.

00:03:56.334 --> 00:03:59.334
Today, as I battle the UV rays
that are so damaging to my skin,

00:03:59.334 --> 00:04:01.774
I work as a farmer.

00:04:02.434 --> 00:04:05.344
Inside of some rather high walls.

00:04:05.344 --> 00:04:07.314
I see you're working hard.

00:04:07.874 --> 00:04:09.974
Eek! Major! It's been too long!

00:04:10.744 --> 00:04:12.414
What's his problem?

00:04:12.414 --> 00:04:17.114
Oh, he talks to himself every so often. Forget it.

00:04:17.554 --> 00:04:20.254
You haven't been visiting me lately.

00:04:20.254 --> 00:04:22.424
Muscle was lonely...

00:04:22.424 --> 00:04:23.894
Who's he?

00:04:24.824 --> 00:04:27.634
He got brought in here about a month ago.

00:04:27.634 --> 00:04:30.254
I think his name is Gunji.

00:04:30.434 --> 00:04:33.504
Word is that he is a very, very dangerous man.

00:04:33.504 --> 00:04:36.844
Probably why he has his own
personal guard with him,

00:04:36.844 --> 00:04:38.934
even when he's doing manual labor.

00:04:39.514 --> 00:04:41.774
Your ride will be here in two hours.

00:04:41.774 --> 00:04:45.044
The surveillance system will be
deactivated shortly before.

00:04:50.754 --> 00:04:53.054
Let me eat my food in peace!

00:04:53.294 --> 00:04:55.354
Leaving so soon?

00:04:55.354 --> 00:04:57.124
Company's coming.

00:05:01.234 --> 00:05:02.724
Is that it?

00:05:02.834 --> 00:05:05.564
Yes. That's the esper prison.

00:05:05.764 --> 00:05:06.404
More commonly known as East Eden.

00:05:06.404 --> 00:05:08.434
EAST EDEN
More commonly known as East Eden.

00:05:08.634 --> 00:05:13.304
Every point on the island is equipped
with ECM: psychic power jammers.

00:05:13.574 --> 00:05:16.564
In addition, each inmate is
fitted with a special limiter.

00:05:17.284 --> 00:05:19.644
They cannot utilize psychic powers.

00:05:20.184 --> 00:05:22.674
The only connection to the
outside is via this heliport.

00:05:23.254 --> 00:05:26.244
Besides at the entrance, there's
a strict security check made...

00:05:26.354 --> 00:05:28.294
as you move between each block.

00:05:28.294 --> 00:05:31.864
Of course, the buildings are
all made to resist ESP.

00:05:31.864 --> 00:05:34.264
The prison's outer wall in particular...

00:05:34.334 --> 00:05:36.924
is made to withstand a direct hit from a missile.

00:05:37.534 --> 00:05:41.334
It's an unfortunate fact that
some espers are criminals.

00:05:41.704 --> 00:05:44.974
And in order to deal with esper criminals...

00:05:44.974 --> 00:05:47.534
facilities such as this are necessary.

00:05:49.274 --> 00:05:51.884
And 500 meters beneath the ground here...

00:05:51.884 --> 00:05:55.874
is a special cell housing the
worst esper criminal of all.

00:05:57.754 --> 00:05:59.384
What's?

00:06:02.654 --> 00:06:05.564
Hello. We meet again.

00:06:06.764 --> 00:06:08.034
You're him!

00:06:08.034 --> 00:06:11.694
So, it was you... Kyosuke Hyobu!

00:06:12.304 --> 00:06:14.774
Whatever do you mean, my dear Kiritsubo?

00:06:14.774 --> 00:06:16.034
Don't play dumb!

00:06:16.104 --> 00:06:19.134
You broke out of here and
infiltrated BABEL headquarters!

00:06:19.574 --> 00:06:22.474
Oh, come now. I couldn't have left here.

00:06:22.474 --> 00:06:26.044
This is the most esper-resistant
room on Earth, isn't it?

00:06:26.414 --> 00:06:28.754
You just said hello to Minamoto!

00:06:28.754 --> 00:06:33.424
Did I? My memory of late is getting a bit hazy.

00:06:33.424 --> 00:06:35.824
No one can defeat old age.

00:06:35.824 --> 00:06:39.064
You'd know how that feels,
wouldn't you, Kiritsubo?

00:06:39.064 --> 00:06:41.064
How old are you?

00:06:41.064 --> 00:06:43.394
He's already past 80.

00:06:43.634 --> 00:06:45.504
80?!

00:06:45.504 --> 00:06:50.044
He holds off the aging process by
controlling the genes which trigger it.

00:06:50.044 --> 00:06:51.974
Using his powers.

00:06:55.814 --> 00:06:58.244
Take a break. Time to be relieved.

00:06:58.244 --> 00:07:00.354
Huh? I thought my relief was going to be...

00:07:00.354 --> 00:07:02.884
Oh, it was a special request from the chief.

00:07:02.884 --> 00:07:05.184
The shift's been changed.

00:07:05.384 --> 00:07:07.154
Why, you!

00:07:08.654 --> 00:07:11.214
Saves me the trouble of punching you.

00:07:11.664 --> 00:07:13.564
He's also capable of psychokinesis,

00:07:13.634 --> 00:07:17.124
teleportation, and a host of other powers.

00:07:17.204 --> 00:07:19.804
And besides that, he's also immune to ECM.

00:07:19.804 --> 00:07:20.994
ECM, too?

00:07:21.834 --> 00:07:23.504
God, the old man's annoying!

00:07:23.504 --> 00:07:26.604
You should rip that cheesy
mustache off and shut him up!

00:07:27.914 --> 00:07:29.644
He has a pet in his cell?!

00:07:29.644 --> 00:07:30.544
Pet?

00:07:30.544 --> 00:07:32.944
Oh? You can see him?

00:07:33.684 --> 00:07:37.054
You aren't that susceptible to hypnosis, are you?

00:07:37.484 --> 00:07:39.824
Perhaps I should be trying more seriously.

00:07:40.024 --> 00:07:42.994
Hypnosis! You're capable of hypno powers?!

00:07:44.524 --> 00:07:48.084
You've been using hypnosis
to hide things from us?!

00:07:50.604 --> 00:07:53.534
What's with this extravagant furniture?!

00:07:54.274 --> 00:07:56.894
The latest electronics and audio system!
Since when did you have those?!

00:08:06.684 --> 00:08:09.704
If I can use my powers, I win.

00:08:11.654 --> 00:08:13.994
Why did you meet with Minamoto?

00:08:13.994 --> 00:08:15.854
Do you want The Children for something?!

00:08:16.424 --> 00:08:20.124
They interest me. They're very cute, after all.

00:08:20.734 --> 00:08:23.724
If I said I wished to marry one in the future...

00:08:23.804 --> 00:08:24.924
what then?

00:08:25.334 --> 00:08:27.274
Marry?! Chief!

00:08:27.274 --> 00:08:29.764
How dare you say that, you old man!

00:08:33.314 --> 00:08:35.744
What's wrong? Caught a cold?

00:08:35.744 --> 00:08:37.874
I just felt a sort of chill, myself.

00:08:39.684 --> 00:08:42.814
I won't allow it! I absolutely will not allow it!

00:08:43.224 --> 00:08:45.454
Chief, calm down a little!

00:08:45.454 --> 00:08:46.854
Now Dad, please...

00:08:46.854 --> 00:08:49.514
Who are you calling "dad," you old fossil?!

00:09:02.004 --> 00:09:04.804
My people are coming to
extract me at the east farm!

00:09:04.804 --> 00:09:07.294
If any of you want out, run for there!

00:09:11.614 --> 00:09:13.134
Stop, or I'll shoot!

00:09:18.684 --> 00:09:20.744
The east beach! Move it!

00:09:28.134 --> 00:09:29.394
What's that alarm?

00:09:29.494 --> 00:09:31.554
Chief! Chief!

00:09:31.634 --> 00:09:35.204
It's a mass escape! A number of
prisoners on the surface are rioting!

00:09:35.204 --> 00:09:39.104
What?! Is this your doing, Major Hyobu?

00:09:39.714 --> 00:09:42.114
Oh, please. I've nothing to do with it.

00:09:42.874 --> 00:09:44.344
Let's go, Minamoto!

00:09:44.344 --> 00:09:45.284
Yes, sir!

00:09:48.014 --> 00:09:50.984
He faces an enemy unlike any
he's dealt with previously.

00:09:50.984 --> 00:09:53.324
Can that kid protect those girls?

00:09:59.124 --> 00:10:01.294
The prisoners have broken
out into the east farm area!

00:10:01.694 --> 00:10:03.764
Get the special espers here at once!

00:10:03.764 --> 00:10:04.904
Chief?

00:10:04.904 --> 00:10:08.004
No telling what may happen if they meet Hyobu.

00:10:08.004 --> 00:10:10.444
We'll have them standing by nearby.

00:10:10.444 --> 00:10:12.744
It's me! Head for the east farm area!

00:10:12.744 --> 00:10:14.304
Chief, wait!

00:10:17.484 --> 00:10:18.544
Hey!

00:10:18.544 --> 00:10:20.214
The east farm! Hurry!

00:10:20.214 --> 00:10:22.184
Let's go!
Right!

00:10:23.724 --> 00:10:24.984
Easy.

00:10:30.964 --> 00:10:32.224
Hold it!

00:10:32.894 --> 00:10:36.594
You use the other prisoners as a decoy
while you escape on your own, huh?

00:10:37.134 --> 00:10:40.164
I'm afraid we can't let you do that, Yasuo Gunji!

00:10:42.374 --> 00:10:46.704
ECCM, on! ECM, neutralized!
Now go, my Naomi!

00:10:46.944 --> 00:10:52.084
Now, behold the power of my Wild Cat,
whom I raised myself!

00:10:52.084 --> 00:10:53.944
Quit saying "my" all the time!

00:10:54.254 --> 00:10:58.984
PSYCHIC STUN SUBJECTION!

00:11:02.524 --> 00:11:04.894
An ESP barrier! But, how?!

00:11:08.334 --> 00:11:12.734
N-Naomi! Impossible! How can
he use his powers here?

00:11:14.404 --> 00:11:16.164
Is that?!

00:11:16.644 --> 00:11:19.374
He has a portable ECCM device?!

00:11:19.974 --> 00:11:22.244
I thought those were only prototypes.

00:11:22.244 --> 00:11:25.114
I can think of a way he could have gotten one.

00:11:25.644 --> 00:11:29.914
It'd be possible for the anti-esper
group Normal People!

00:11:31.324 --> 00:11:34.594
If Gunji gets out, he'd most likely return to crime.

00:11:34.594 --> 00:11:39.394
They probably intend to use that as
propaganda that espers are dangerous.

00:11:39.864 --> 00:11:41.734
He must not escape!

00:11:41.734 --> 00:11:44.334
Minamoto, call The Children to action!

00:11:44.334 --> 00:11:45.324
Right!

00:11:45.464 --> 00:11:47.064
The Children, released!

00:11:50.174 --> 00:11:51.274
Pretty Soldier Cure
We'll be back, after these messages!

00:11:51.274 --> 00:11:51.704
We'll be back, after these messages!

00:11:51.704 --> 00:11:53.244
What? The commercials, already?

00:11:53.244 --> 00:11:55.264
We've barely seen the main characters.

00:11:55.414 --> 00:11:57.244
Is that really a good way to run a show?

00:11:57.384 --> 00:11:58.914
Shonen Yunday!

00:11:58.914 --> 00:11:59.884
Shonen Yunday
Shonen Yunday!

00:12:00.084 --> 00:12:01.914
Just get over here, already!

00:12:03.924 --> 00:12:05.424
Beware of imitations!

00:12:05.424 --> 00:12:06.544
Right!

00:12:09.694 --> 00:12:11.924
Northern Light Suplex!

00:12:12.394 --> 00:12:14.564
Forget the prisoners who've run to the farm!

00:12:14.564 --> 00:12:16.584
Everyone, after Gunji!

00:12:18.204 --> 00:12:20.634
Damn! They figured out my plan!

00:12:21.004 --> 00:12:25.334
But I've come this far. All that's
left is to jump out of here.

00:12:25.644 --> 00:12:27.234
So long!

00:12:33.784 --> 00:12:35.444
ECCM, on!

00:12:35.654 --> 00:12:39.754
The criminal is using ESP to
scale the western out wall.

00:12:39.754 --> 00:12:41.254
Get him!

00:12:41.254 --> 00:12:44.594
You're in my way! Now fall!

00:12:48.834 --> 00:12:49.764
Psychokinesis!

00:13:02.544 --> 00:13:04.744
The fragrant morning is bright-red justice!

00:13:05.214 --> 00:13:07.374
The wind blowing in the field is blue friendship!

00:13:07.884 --> 00:13:10.514
And the violet mixed in is a noble heart!

00:13:13.154 --> 00:13:15.484
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:13:18.464 --> 00:13:20.624
At last, they appear.

00:13:22.264 --> 00:13:24.134
I've heard of you.

00:13:24.134 --> 00:13:28.104
True, you're the only three Level 7's in Japan.

00:13:28.104 --> 00:13:31.604
But now I can see you're nothing but little kids.

00:13:31.604 --> 00:13:34.044
You seriously think you can beat me?!

00:13:34.414 --> 00:13:37.574
Why don't I show you how serious we are?

00:13:37.914 --> 00:13:39.274
Kaoru, wait!

00:13:39.644 --> 00:13:42.774
PSYCHIC IRON HAMMER!

00:13:48.054 --> 00:13:49.254
Like that?!

00:13:50.264 --> 00:13:53.624
Very powerful, as I'd expect of a Level 7.

00:13:54.234 --> 00:13:58.534
I hit him, full blast! Why's the
wall destroyed, but he's okay?

00:13:58.664 --> 00:14:02.534
He ducked down and concentrated
a barrier over a smaller area.

00:14:02.804 --> 00:14:07.544
But, luckily, you just blasted this
reinforced wall down for me.

00:14:07.544 --> 00:14:10.034
Saves me the trouble of scaling it.

00:14:12.444 --> 00:14:17.254
He used to serve in the military's
special esper unit.

00:14:17.454 --> 00:14:20.054
You mean he's a pro at ESP warfare?!

00:14:20.054 --> 00:14:22.544
Tell me these things beforehand!

00:14:22.894 --> 00:14:24.624
Chief, look!

00:14:25.194 --> 00:14:26.964
His partners!

00:14:26.964 --> 00:14:29.624
Aoi! Use your teleportation to stop them!

00:14:30.034 --> 00:14:34.124
Um... For some reason, my
head's started spinning...

00:14:35.274 --> 00:14:36.204
Aoi!

00:14:42.114 --> 00:14:45.774
Cerebral concussion!
You shook her skull, didn't you?

00:14:46.284 --> 00:14:49.654
Keep interfering and I'll show you no mercy.

00:14:49.654 --> 00:14:51.554
Kids should stay home and be quiet!

00:14:51.924 --> 00:14:54.254
Wh-What was that, you jerk?!

00:14:54.524 --> 00:14:57.614
Oh, you idiot. It's nothing personal!

00:14:57.894 --> 00:14:59.484
Kaoru! Behind you!

00:15:01.994 --> 00:15:03.634
This thing...

00:15:03.634 --> 00:15:05.934
Left me a clear shot!

00:15:09.004 --> 00:15:11.404
Oh, no. I can't raise a barrier in time.

00:15:11.644 --> 00:15:13.734
KAORU!

00:15:15.874 --> 00:15:19.214
It's okay. Deflect them obliquely
instead of straight on.

00:15:22.884 --> 00:15:24.084
What?!

00:15:24.654 --> 00:15:26.954
See? You did it.

00:15:26.954 --> 00:15:28.654
Wh-Who?

00:15:29.254 --> 00:15:30.224
Hyobu!

00:15:30.394 --> 00:15:32.384
He got out again?!

00:15:32.764 --> 00:15:34.464
Next, the attack.

00:15:34.464 --> 00:15:38.004
Basically, you concentrate your
power into a single, tiny point.

00:15:38.004 --> 00:15:40.004
Nothing in this world can be safe

00:15:40.004 --> 00:15:42.134
from the power you can wring from yourself.

00:15:42.534 --> 00:15:45.634
It will make you stronger.

00:15:47.814 --> 00:15:51.714
This is for Aoi! PSYCHIC PINPOINT SHOOT!

00:15:53.244 --> 00:15:55.944
Are... Are you kidding me?!

00:15:56.954 --> 00:15:59.254
I can't block that kind of power!

00:15:59.584 --> 00:16:01.214
Hey! Don't run away!

00:16:06.264 --> 00:16:08.924
No! My escape ship!

00:16:11.364 --> 00:16:13.394
Kaoru, stop it!

00:16:15.334 --> 00:16:20.174
There's no need to stop. Now, try
controlling the power a bit more.

00:16:20.174 --> 00:16:23.274
Concentrate power on a tiny point.

00:16:23.274 --> 00:16:24.644
Control the power.

00:16:27.714 --> 00:16:29.244
I... I surrender!

00:16:29.484 --> 00:16:31.784
Kaoru, stop it!

00:16:32.724 --> 00:16:37.554
She's finally learning how to
attack using her powers.

00:16:38.024 --> 00:16:41.624
Why is it you haven't taught her until now?

00:16:41.994 --> 00:16:46.094
Concentrate on a point, control...
Concentrate on a point...

00:16:46.604 --> 00:16:50.574
Your teaching these girls only
what you deem necessary...

00:16:50.574 --> 00:16:55.034
means you're like the Normal People,
and view espers as a threat, doesn't it?

00:16:55.314 --> 00:16:57.334
No! You're wrong!

00:16:58.314 --> 00:17:03.924
We teach them what their minds
and bodies can handle!

00:17:03.924 --> 00:17:05.854
You can't just appear on the sidelines

00:17:05.854 --> 00:17:07.944
and start criticizing our training methods!

00:17:08.524 --> 00:17:10.294
What you're doing now is like taking

00:17:10.294 --> 00:17:12.964
an elementary school student
who finally grasps fractions

00:17:12.964 --> 00:17:15.954
and suddenly giving them a calculus problem!

00:17:16.764 --> 00:17:19.604
Concentrate... Concentrate...

00:17:19.604 --> 00:17:21.504
Keep pushing her like this, and...

00:17:21.774 --> 00:17:24.964
Concentrate... Concentrate!

00:17:25.874 --> 00:17:26.774
Oh, no.

00:17:26.774 --> 00:17:29.214
Aoi, wake up. Hurry!

00:17:37.884 --> 00:17:39.684
You two okay?

00:17:39.684 --> 00:17:41.594
Just barely.

00:17:41.594 --> 00:17:42.994
The problem's out there.

00:17:45.764 --> 00:17:48.564
This isn't good. She's completely snapped.

00:17:48.564 --> 00:17:50.994
She's going to hurt herself, too.

00:17:52.604 --> 00:17:55.434
I see. This definitely isn't good.

00:17:56.074 --> 00:17:59.374
I was a bit premature in doing this.

00:17:59.374 --> 00:18:01.634
She's still more of a child then I realized.

00:18:02.174 --> 00:18:05.314
ECM doesn't work on her
when she loses control!

00:18:05.314 --> 00:18:07.214
What can we do?!

00:18:07.214 --> 00:18:08.984
I have an idea.

00:18:08.984 --> 00:18:13.924
Nearby is the most ESP-resistant
room on the planet.

00:18:14.124 --> 00:18:19.924
I get you. We seal Kaoru in there
till she regains her senses.

00:18:20.594 --> 00:18:23.294
However, there is one problem.

00:18:23.764 --> 00:18:29.294
I doubt that even I can teleport while
maintaining a barrier against that.

00:18:29.974 --> 00:18:32.604
You can leave the teleporting to me!

00:18:32.604 --> 00:18:33.764
Aoi...

00:18:33.844 --> 00:18:35.774
I'm coming, too.

00:18:36.614 --> 00:18:38.744
So this guy doesn't betray us.

00:18:39.114 --> 00:18:43.484
Shiho... I'm coming, too. I have
a responsibility to protect you.

00:18:43.884 --> 00:18:45.424
Then I'll come, too!

00:18:45.424 --> 00:18:46.974
No thanks, Chief.

00:18:47.324 --> 00:18:48.724
AGGHH!

00:18:49.154 --> 00:18:51.724
Okay, let's do this. You ready with the barrier?

00:18:51.724 --> 00:18:52.524
Yes.

00:18:52.524 --> 00:18:54.014
Teleport!

00:18:59.804 --> 00:19:01.904
She's reached this point!

00:19:01.904 --> 00:19:04.034
No good! I need to get closer!

00:19:04.204 --> 00:19:06.004
Gotcha!

00:19:11.014 --> 00:19:13.484
This is to save Kaoru!

00:19:14.484 --> 00:19:17.354
Yeah... I know!

00:19:42.714 --> 00:19:44.474
Almost!

00:19:45.414 --> 00:19:46.934
Almost!

00:19:52.424 --> 00:19:54.684
Got her! Teleport!

00:19:58.994 --> 00:20:00.364
The hell?!

00:20:00.364 --> 00:20:03.704
The ESP storm's died down. It worked!

00:20:03.704 --> 00:20:06.904
We've also restrained a guard who
was helping the rioting prisoners.

00:20:06.904 --> 00:20:08.404
Case closed!

00:20:08.404 --> 00:20:08.904
All right!

00:20:08.904 --> 00:20:09.474
Anyway, are The Children all right?!
All right!

00:20:09.474 --> 00:20:10.974
Anyway, are The Children all right?!
Yay!

00:20:10.974 --> 00:20:11.604
Anyway, are The Children all right?!

00:20:11.604 --> 00:20:13.804
Well, Minamoto?!
Sir, that's enough.

00:20:13.914 --> 00:20:16.034
Shiho, Aoi! Get away from him!

00:20:16.374 --> 00:20:18.044
That man's a dangerous criminal!

00:20:19.884 --> 00:20:21.004
Dangerous criminal?

00:20:21.484 --> 00:20:24.624
Although, I'm thankful to
him for saving us from

00:20:24.624 --> 00:20:28.114
a dangerous situation and
thinking to use this place.

00:20:28.854 --> 00:20:31.624
Thank you for protecting her.

00:20:35.164 --> 00:20:40.364
Minamoto? He said I can be stronger...

00:20:40.934 --> 00:20:43.634
I know that.

00:20:44.244 --> 00:20:48.974
But there's no need to rush. I'll wait for you.

00:20:54.654 --> 00:20:57.554
I'll leave the queen with you for today.

00:20:58.584 --> 00:20:59.854
Queen?

00:21:00.294 --> 00:21:02.814
We interlopers should make our exit.

00:21:05.024 --> 00:21:09.594
Oh, and tell Kiritsubo that this
room will now be closed.

00:21:09.594 --> 00:21:13.904
I found a nice place on the outside.
I'll be moving there now.

00:21:13.904 --> 00:21:15.204
Until next time.

00:21:15.774 --> 00:21:18.104
"Moving outside"?

00:21:19.044 --> 00:21:21.674
He just escaped!

00:21:28.484 --> 00:21:29.784
What's with you?

00:21:29.784 --> 00:21:32.024
You're forcing yourself, aren't you, Kyosuke?

00:21:32.024 --> 00:21:34.624
Escaping earlier than you'd planned...

00:21:34.624 --> 00:21:36.884
He put one over on you today, didn't he?

00:21:37.364 --> 00:21:40.434
Not particularly. It's just...

00:21:40.434 --> 00:21:42.594
I was tired of waiting.

00:21:42.594 --> 00:21:46.034
She was just so cute, you know?

00:21:46.964 --> 00:21:50.234
My queen... Hurry and grow to adulthood.

00:21:51.104 --> 00:21:53.634
By the way, did we forget something?

00:21:53.814 --> 00:21:55.974
Did we? What?

00:21:55.974 --> 00:21:57.544
Hmm...

00:21:57.544 --> 00:22:01.154
Oh, well. Couldn't have been that important.

00:22:01.154 --> 00:22:03.314
We both must be getting senile.

00:22:07.854 --> 00:22:10.654
My name is Muscle Ohkama.

00:22:11.824 --> 00:22:14.524
Why am I the only one who ended up like this?

00:22:14.764 --> 00:22:19.294
Hurry up and save me, Major!

00:22:29.514 --> 00:22:34.644
Kakushitemo muda da yo

00:22:34.954 --> 00:22:39.014
Nandemo zenbu wakaru

00:22:39.754 --> 00:22:45.194
Fushigi ja nai yo datte atashi wa

00:22:45.564 --> 00:22:50.964
Anata wo ai shite n da mon

00:22:51.204 --> 00:22:55.604
Hora kochi muite

00:22:55.874 --> 00:23:00.174
Maji de love x love musubareru no wa

00:23:00.174 --> 00:23:02.144
Zettai nan desu!

00:23:02.374 --> 00:23:07.084
Zutto eien fuhen

00:23:07.084 --> 00:23:13.724
Everest kara sekaiju ni zettai sengen!

00:23:13.724 --> 00:23:18.564
Mou uketomete

00:23:18.564 --> 00:23:22.964
Futari love x love musubareru no wa

00:23:22.964 --> 00:23:25.164
Zettai nan desu!

00:23:25.164 --> 00:23:29.604
Yappa daian kibou

00:23:29.904 --> 00:23:34.014
San Pietro de chikau ai no

00:23:34.014 --> 00:23:36.804
Zettai sengen!

00:23:49.994 --> 00:23:51.164
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:51.164 --> 00:23:52.994
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children.

00:23:52.994 --> 00:23:53.724
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children.

00:23:53.724 --> 00:23:55.294
Minamoto, men like you

00:23:55.294 --> 00:23:58.904
inevitably make their move on
the espers in their care.

00:23:58.904 --> 00:24:01.134
Don't assume I'm a pervert like you!

00:24:01.134 --> 00:24:02.834
Then let me prove it to you.

00:24:02.834 --> 00:24:04.074
Minamoto.

00:24:04.074 --> 00:24:06.404
Mr. Minamoto.

00:24:06.704 --> 00:24:08.074
Zettai Karen Children!

00:24:08.444 --> 00:24:11.644
Episode 9: "Gorgeous Bods!
We're Grown-Ups Now?!"

00:24:11.644 --> 00:24:14.454
Who cares if they just look
like they've grown a bit?!

00:24:14.454 --> 00:24:15.014
I am a normal, upstanding person!

00:24:15.014 --> 00:24:16.514
Gorgeous Bods!
We're Grown-Ups Now!?
I am a normal, upstanding person!

00:24:16.514 --> 00:24:18.884
Gorgeous Bods!
We're Grown-Ups Now!?
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:18.884 --> 00:24:19.984
Gorgeous Bods!
We're Grown-Ups Now!?
